import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 179 | Nine-Realms Overview: The Energy-Level Watershed Between Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms and Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 179 | Nine-Realms Overview: The Energy-Level Watershed Between Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms and Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms","no":179,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Nine-Realms Overview","Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms","Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms","Energy-Level Watershed"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0179_模块1-九境总览-凡修五境与圣修四境能级分水岭.md","filePath":"en/0179_模块1-九境总览-凡修五境与圣修四境能级分水岭.md"}'),r={name:"en/0179_模块1-九境总览-凡修五境与圣修四境能级分水岭.md"};function o(l,e,s,d,c,u){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-179-nine-realms-overview-the-energy-level-watershed-between-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-and-four-sacred-cultivation-realms" tabindex="-1">Entry 179 | Nine-Realms Overview: The Energy-Level Watershed Between Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms and Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-179-nine-realms-overview-the-energy-level-watershed-between-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-and-four-sacred-cultivation-realms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 179 | Nine-Realms Overview: The Energy-Level Watershed Between Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms and Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 00, 10</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-watershed-separates-two-evolutionary-worldviews" tabindex="-1">Introduction: One watershed separates two evolutionary worldviews <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-watershed-separates-two-evolutionary-worldviews" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: One watershed separates two evolutionary worldviews&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s unified realm classification has nine realms: Sense Origin, Condensed Origin, Transform Origin, Law Origin, Dao Origin, Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin. The first five are the &quot;five mortal-cultivation realms,&quot; the last four are the &quot;four sacred-cultivation realms.&quot; This dividing line is not an artificial rank label, but a watershed where energy-level essence, responsibility volume, and karmic cost all simultaneously leap. Understanding this watershed is understanding why the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization both makes &quot;paths for all&quot; reach the five mortal-cultivation realms, and guards the sacred-cultivation four realms&#39; entrance with four-dimensional assessment.</p><p>The six top-level axioms take layered effect here: the anti-predation axiom requires whether mortal or sacred, energy always comes from creation and circulation not devouring; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the five-realm path to be open to 99% of Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom requires sacred-cultivation strong ones not to ascend alone, but uplift mortal-cultivation beings forward together; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the closer to origin, the stricter the filing and restraint of cross-plane operations; the law-first axiom ensures the nine-realm definitions never rewrite, never inflate with plot; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry overviews the watershed&#39;s energy-level structure, providing a unified coordinate for subsequent detailed entries.</p><h2 id="i-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-evolutionary-basic-education-accessible-to-all" tabindex="-1">I. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms: &quot;Evolutionary Basic Education&quot; Accessible to All <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-evolutionary-basic-education-accessible-to-all" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms: &quot;Evolutionary Basic Education&quot; Accessible to All&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The five mortal-cultivation realms (Sense Origin, Condensed Origin, Transform Origin, Law Origin, Dao Origin) share the feature: cultivators still mainly operate in material planes and energy layers, energy comes from environmental circulation and anchor network supply, the individual&#39;s manipulation of laws is &quot;understanding and using&quot; not &quot;rewriting and creating.&quot;</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm</th><th>Core Lesson</th><th>Energy Scale</th><th>Typical Social Role</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense Origin Realm</td><td>Perceive energy and law aura</td><td>Trace infiltration</td><td>Beginner</td></tr><tr><td>Condensed Origin Realm</td><td>Condense energy, establish internal circulation</td><td>Basic reserve</td><td>Junior cultivator</td></tr><tr><td>Transform Origin Realm</td><td>Energy purification and transformation</td><td>Intermediate usable</td><td>Social backbone, grassroots mentor</td></tr><tr><td>Law Origin Realm</td><td>Energy and law initially merge, birth law power</td><td>Advanced combat power</td><td>Technical expert, mid-level management</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Attain personal Dao, cross-plane consciousness perception</td><td>Grandmaster level</td><td>Civilization consultant, senior mentor</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five mortal-cultivation realms&#39; design goal is &quot;compulsory education full coverage&quot;: any human male/female, Youth Supreme, Myriad Races being, relying on the 300 Origin Cultivation Systems and joint contracting resource allocation, should be able to reach Dao Origin Realm. This stage&#39;s bottleneck is mainly method and time, not birth and monopoly.</p><h2 id="ii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-energy-level-and-responsibility-simultaneously-leap" tabindex="-1">II. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms: Energy Level and Responsibility Simultaneously Leap <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-energy-level-and-responsibility-simultaneously-leap" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms: Energy Level and Responsibility Simultaneously Leap&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four sacred-cultivation realms (Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin) share the feature: the cultivator&#39;s way of existence itself begins to change the cosmos — Dao Integration ones rewrite local laws, Boundary-Breaking ones operate the plane membrane, World-Creation ones create complete worlds in isolated space, Origin ones participate in cosmic law fine-tuning.</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm</th><th>Core Leap</th><th>Energy Nature</th><th>Responsibility Volume</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dao Integration Realm</td><td>Personal Dao deeply merges with origin laws</td><td>Law domain forms</td><td>Grandmaster level, influencing civilization direction</td></tr><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm</td><td>Anchor-free cross-plane, operating plane membrane</td><td>Plane level</td><td>Independently bearing plane-level tasks</td></tr><tr><td>World-Creation Realm</td><td>Creating complete worlds and law systems</td><td>World level</td><td>Creating cultivation resources and refuges</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Touching origin, participating in law fine-tuning</td><td>Cosmic level</td><td>Plane Transcendent threshold</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Why the watershed is an &quot;energy-level watershed&quot;: errors in the five mortal-cultivation realms at most hurt oneself and the local area; one misjudgment in the four sacred-cultivation realms can affect an entire plane or even cross-plane causality. Therefore the four sacred-cultivation realms&#39; entrance must be double-gated by anchor certification and Standard Committee assessment.</p><h2 id="iii-the-watershed-s-triple-criteria" tabindex="-1">III. The Watershed&#39;s Triple Criteria <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-watershed-s-triple-criteria" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Watershed&#39;s Triple Criteria&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The watershed is not a single threshold of some realm, but three criteria simultaneously crossed:</p><ol><li><strong>Energy criterion</strong>: three indicators — energy purity, law manipulation precision, consciousness evolution — simultaneously cross the Dao Origin→Dao Integration threshold, none dispensable.</li><li><strong>Karma criterion</strong>: has the cultivator passed ethics review, confirming cross-plane operations observe first then limited interference, only relay knowledge not disturb causality.</li><li><strong>Contribution criterion</strong>: does one have actual contribution records of giving back to Myriad Races, not merely personal combat power met.</li></ol><p>These three criteria directly correspond to the Plane Transcendent four-dimensional assessment system (power 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15)&#39;s front projection at the watershed.</p><h2 id="iv-two-realm-extensions-beyond-the-watershed" tabindex="-1">IV. Two Realm Extensions Beyond the Watershed <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-two-realm-extensions-beyond-the-watershed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Two Realm Extensions Beyond the Watershed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Above the nine realms, the setting also marks two extension realms pending terminology committee calibration: Multiverse Realm and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm (alias &quot;Hyper-Multiverse Balanced Anchor Realm&quot;). They are the direction of continued ascension after the Origin Realm; this entry only gives coordinate hints: the Multiverse Realm points to law network nodes across multiverse scale, the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm points to the ultimate ascension form of Myriad Races co-building and whole-network sharing. Detailed deduction see Entry 214.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: layering the &quot;accessible to all&quot; five mortal-cultivation realms and &quot;strictly assessed&quot; four sacred-cultivation realms, avoiding low-level ones forced to bear high-level costs, and avoiding high-level ones being underused</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: at the watershed there is no &quot;devour to break through&quot; shortcut; predatory energy hits a &quot;impure origin&quot; hard bottleneck at Dao Origin Realm</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: in Tang-Luo-style gift systems, commoners&#39; ceiling is locked at low ranks; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five mortal-cultivation realms are fully free and open, the watershed only screens mind and contribution, not birth</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five mortal-cultivation realms cover 99% of Myriad Races races, the four sacred-cultivation realms similarly reserve channels for plant spirits, planetary consciousness, mechanical tribes, etc., not human-exclusive</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: nine-realm definitions, certification standards, and methods are all public, no hoarding monopoly, infinitely expandable without collapse</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The five mortal-cultivation realms are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;entry ticket&quot; for all beings; the four sacred-cultivation realms are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;responsibility bond&quot; for strong ones. What this energy-level watershed separates is never high/low/noble/base, but &quot;how much karmic cause you can bear.&quot; With the watershed explained clearly, the nine-realm system has the skeleton of infinitely expanding without collapse.</p><p>In the final analysis, the nine-realms overview · five mortal-cultivation and four sacred-cultivation energy-level watershed described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const v=t(r,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,v as default};
